  "label": "Christchurch Mosque Shootings",
  "description": "A horrific terrorist attack that occurred on March 15, 2019, in Christchurch, New Zealand, where a gunman killed 51 people and injured 49 others in two mosques during Friday prayers. This event is one of the deadliest acts of terrorism in New Zealand's history and sparked global outrage and solidarity with the Muslim community. The meme references this tragedy by implying the victims' belongings (shoes) are for sale, which is a deeply insensitive and harmful trivialization of the event and its victims.",
